rowser","url":"http://edusim3dweb.com"},{"id":"6b9f05fd-352c-4d5a-8b0b-eeeab557381b","createdAt":1786942188079,"transform":{"position":[-24,-0.15613295089316237,78],"rotation":[0,0.54,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":1,"title":"Raise the obelisk","target":"Click the left-hand obelisk → Program.","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"repeat 20 times","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move up by 0.6 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.15 seconds","depth":1}],"tip":"Egyptian crews raised these by hauling them upright onto a base with ropes and sand — no cranes, no pulleys. Yours cheats and floats. Change 0.6 to 0.1 and watch how much more convincing slow is than fast, then put \"go back to start\" on the end to drop it home again.","accent":"#c2861f"}},{"id":"8ca8a9ac-862a-4cbc-ad58-095cd6645c3f","createdAt":1786942188080,"transform":{"position":[26,0.06581189047350167,78],"rotation":[0,-0.58,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":2,"title":"Sail the ship of the sun","target":"Click Khufu’s ship → Program.","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move forward 22 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 2 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 180 degrees","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"move forward 22 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 2 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 180 degrees","depth":1}],"tip":"move forward follows the hull, so the rotate genuinely turns the boat round rather than just spinning it on the spot. Swap move forward for glide 40 feet over 6 seconds and it stops teleporting and starts steaming.","accent":"#7d5044"}},{"id":"b7375d9f-04c1-44c5-bf9a-6f3e28aa8d52","createdAt":1786942188081,"transform":{"position":[-34,7.944034569469911,44],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f2a541"},{"id":"4c3a9b5a-f996-4baa-8b5f-6227bdf38f6d","cre